            "id": "s2:p1",
            "text": "Plants of the World Online account: Tricholaena teneriffae (L.f.) Link."
          },
          {
            "id": "s2:p2",
            "text": "The native range of this species is Macaronesia to SW. Italy and India, NE. & E. Tropical Africa. It is a perennial and grows primarily in the desert or dry shrubland biome."
